OL,3,GNEWSA'Poo Man' patrol launched to
OL,4,Atackle dog fouling
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new dog fouling warden nicknamed the
OL,7,F"Poo Man" is to patrol the Isle of Man
OL,8,Fas part of a three-month trial aimed at
OL,9,Ftackling dog mess and educating owners.
OL,11,FShaun Pearce, who runs a private dog
OL,12,Fwaste-clearing business, will have
OL,13,Fpowers to enforce local by-laws but
OL,14,Fsays he hopes education will be enough
OL,15,Fto change people's behaviour.
OL,17,FPearce will patrol Laxey promenade and
OL,18,Fthe wider Garff parish, where dog
OL,19,Ffouling has become a growing concern.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
FL,451,445,260,140,0,100
